{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17829","headline":"送李舍人归兰陵里 · 杨巨源","name":"送李舍人归兰陵里","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清词举世皆藏箧，美酒当山爲满罇。\n三亩嫩蔬临绮陌，四行高树拥朱门。\n家贫境胜心无累，名重官闲口不论。\n惟有道情常自足，啓期天地易知恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17829.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17829","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}